WEBVTT

00:00:03.900 --> 00:00:04.841
Cold boot.

00:00:04.841 --> 00:00:09.167
One relic, one glowing forge, a ghost finger.

00:00:09.167 --> 00:00:15.281
The player forges, drags one relic onto its twin, and they fuse.

00:00:15.281 --> 00:00:21.677
In scripted sessions, the first merge lands in six to nine seconds.

00:00:22.977 --> 00:00:24.412
This is the loop.

00:00:24.412 --> 00:00:27.621
Two of a kind become one older relic.

00:00:27.621 --> 00:00:36.233
Gold arcs into the counter, the camera shakes harder with every tier, and quick chains build a combo.

00:00:36.233 --> 00:00:39.019
There is no energy and no timer.

00:00:39.019 --> 00:00:40.961
The forge never locks.

00:00:40.961 --> 00:00:43.662
A new tier prints a share card.

00:00:43.662 --> 00:00:46.533
That is our one shareable moment.

00:00:52.477 --> 00:00:57.776
The first dollar is a welcome pack, shown after the first merge.

00:00:57.776 --> 00:01:05.145
Its deadline is real, forty-eight hours, and its value number is computed, not invented.

00:01:05.145 --> 00:01:11.686
Chests publish their odds and pity, next to an exact item you can buy instead.

00:01:11.686 --> 00:01:15.660
Under-sixteen profiles never get a random roll.

00:01:15.660 --> 00:01:19.055
A full vault opens a helper, not a wall.

00:01:20.355 --> 00:01:21.734
Twelve sessions.

00:01:21.734 --> 00:01:22.769
All robots.

00:01:22.769 --> 00:01:23.890
Zero humans.

00:01:23.890 --> 00:01:38.372
Telemetry reaches a real collector, but the number that decides this product, first merge inside thirty seconds and seven-day return, needs two hundred human sessions.

00:01:39.972 --> 00:01:46.955
Green unit tests certified a build that froze on its first forge and sold random chests to children.

00:01:46.955 --> 00:01:55.125
Only a scripted screenshot playthrough, and a fresh-context Critic that reads the Soul before the spec, caught them.

00:01:56.725 --> 00:01:58.361
Proposed doctrine.

00:01:58.361 --> 00:02:02.270
Unit tests certify rules, not the product.

00:02:02.270 --> 00:02:10.452
And a brief inherits Soul: if a spec asks for false urgency, the Critic patches the spec.
